{"3379590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "I found myself in a strange house and I'm scared", "steam_appid": 3379590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "I found myself in a strange house and I'm scared. I think I got into some kind of loop. The house is constantly changing, surely I saw something inexplicable and terrible. I have to get out of here. Every time I go through a cycle, one of the chains on the basement door disappears. I should probably get in there and get out of here. I'm very scared.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379590/extras/9597e32aaebfda91398588daf9c2d869.avif?t=1758470430\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Anomaly search game<br></li><li>Huge number of anomalies<br></li><li>Several endings<br></li><li>Creepy atmosphere<br></li><li>Psychological horror<br></li><li>Achievements</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379590/extras/2c3bc0a0e443867b138572b08192c520.avif?t=1758470430\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore the strange house.<br></li><li>If you find an anomaly, turn back immediately.<br></li><li>If you don't find any anomalies, do not turn back.<br></li><li>There are no anomalies on the first level.<br></li><li>Try to get out of here.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379590/extras/858654c74223ce5bcce8ede4b502c62a.avif?t=1758470430\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>Special thanks to Nix Ellison and Sergej Kuzmin.<br>", "about_the_game": "I found myself in a strange house and I'm scared. I think I got into some kind of loop. The house is constantly changing, surely I saw something inexplicable and terrible. I have to get